- spellings:
  - -movflags
  value_name: flags
  value_kind: Required
  choices:
  - name: rtphint
    description: E.......... Add RTP hint tracks
  - name: empty_moov
    description: E.......... Make the initial moov atom empty
  - name: frag_keyframe
    description: E.......... Fragment at video keyframes
  - name: frag_every_frame
    description: E.......... Fragment at every frame
  - name: separate_moof
    description: E.......... Write separate moof/mdat atoms for each track
  - name: frag_custom
    description: E.......... Flush fragments on caller requests
  - name: isml
    description: E.......... Create a live smooth streaming feed (for pushing to a publishing point)
  - name: faststart
    description: E.......... Run a second pass to put the index (moov atom) at the beginning of the file
  - name: omit_tfhd_offset
    description: E.......... Omit the base data offset in tfhd atoms
  - name: disable_chpl
    description: E.......... Disable Nero chapter atom
  - name: default_base_moof
    description: E.......... Set the default-base-is-moof flag in tfhd atoms
  - name: dash
    description: E.......... Write DASH compatible fragmented MP4
  - name: cmaf
    description: E.......... Write CMAF compatible fragmented MP4
  - name: frag_discont
    description: E.......... Signal that the next fragment is discontinuous from earlier ones
  - name: delay_moov
    description: E.......... Delay writing the initial moov until the first fragment is cut, or until the first fragment flush
  - name: global_sidx
    description: E.......... Write a global sidx index at the start of the file
  - name: skip_sidx
    description: E.......... Skip writing of sidx atom
  - name: write_colr
    description: E.......... Write colr atom even if the color info is unspecified (Experimental, may be renamed or changed, do not use from scripts)
  - name: prefer_icc
    description: E.......... If writing colr atom prioritise usage of ICC profile if it exists in stream packet side data
  - name: write_gama
    description: E.......... Write deprecated gama atom
  - name: use_metadata_tags
    description: E.......... Use mdta atom for metadata.
  - name: skip_trailer
    description: E.......... Skip writing the mfra/tfra/mfro trailer for fragmented files
  - name: negative_cts_offsets
    description: E.......... Use negative CTS offsets (reducing the need for edit lists)
  group: 'mov/mp4/tgp/psp/tg2/ipod/ismv/f4v muxer AVOptions:'
