    description: E.......... Use MP4A-LATM packetization instead of MPEG4-GENERIC for AAC
  - name: rfc2190
    description: E.......... Use RFC 2190 packetization instead of RFC 4629 for H.263
  - name: skip_rtcp
    description: E.......... Don't send RTCP sender reports
  - name: h264_mode0
    description: E.......... Use mode 0 for H.264 in RTP
  - name: send_bye
    description: E.......... Send RTCP BYE packets when finishing
